// % (Previous) block: the reply above ends with an open question, and
// without this, a bare "yes"/"no"/"maybe" answer to it falls through to
// unknown.rive — same gap class the confirm-name flow already solved.
// "Yes" proactively names one subject instead of asking another open
// question, so it doesn't need its own further %-scoping. Word lists are
// shared (begin.rive's yeswords/nowords/maybewords), not retyped here.
+ (@yeswords)
% [*] would you like to know more about a specific company or area [*]
- <set unknownStreak=0><set userIntention=experiencefollowup><set botIntention=<bot intent_experiencefollowup>>Sure — his most recent role has been at Smart Debrief. Ask about that, or any other company, skill, or topic you are curious about.

